      "prose_text": {
        "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi#Economy",
        "html": "Nairobi is home to the <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2384385\">Nairobi Securities Exchange</a> (NSE), one of Africa's largest <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11691\">stock exchanges</a>. The NSE was officially recognised as an overseas stock exchange by the <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q171240\">London Stock Exchange</a> in 1953. The exchange is Africa's fourth largest in terms of trading volumes, and fifth largest in terms of Market Capitalization as a percentage of GDP.",
